-- Goal: Camp in woods on west bank of the river (Distance: 951)
UPDATE goals SET description = 'The Fellowship drifted slowly down the Great River Anduin, the golden light of Lothlórien fading into memory behind them. As twilight deepened, Aragorn signalled for the small fleet of grey elven-boats to make for the western bank, where the trees offered coverage from watching eyes. The company drew their vessels up onto the muddy shore and established a quiet camp beneath the dark boughs of the river-woods. Sleep came slowly that first night away from the protection of Galadriel, with only the murmuring flow of the Anduin to mark the passing hours.' WHERE distance = 951 * 1.60934;

